                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/releases/tag/v13.4.2"&gt;Aspire 13.4.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's New in Aspire 13.4.2&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Patch release for Aspire 13.4 with a fix for Redis persistent container deadlock on startup when using TLS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🐛 Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔴 &lt;strong&gt;Redis with &lt;code&gt;WithLifetime(ContainerLifetime.Persistent)&lt;/code&gt; could deadlock on startup&lt;/strong&gt; — Redis TLS startup arguments used the public/allocated host ports instead of the internal target ports. When the public port differed from the target port (or was not yet allocated) the container would listen on an unexpected port and become unreachable. The TLS and non-TLS startup arguments now bind to target ports, matching what Redis expects internally. Fixes &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4568356018" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17822" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/issues/17822/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17822"&gt;#17822&lt;/a&gt;. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4568793536" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17827" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17827/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17827"&gt;#17827&lt;/a&gt;, backported via &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4574814008" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17850" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17850/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17850"&gt;#17850&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;code&gt;@danegsta&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🏷️ Housekeeping&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Bumped branding to 13.4.2 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4582519987" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17876" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17876/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17876"&gt;#17876&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full Changelog: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/compare/v13.4.1...v13.4.2"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v13.4.1...v13.4.2&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full commit: &lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/commit/d7d0b6759ce4b936c76bc4775814d27db560dd6d"&gt;d7d0b6759ce4b936c76bc4775814d27db560dd6d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Generated by &lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/actions/runs/26920328099/agentic_workflow"&gt;Generate release notes for a new stable Aspire release&lt;/a&gt; · ● 5M&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/releases/tag/v13.4.1"&gt;Aspire 13.4.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's New in Aspire 13.4.1&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Patch release for Aspire 13.4 with fixes for explicit-start resource lifecycle callbacks, Redis persistent container startup, proxyless endpoint allocation, and a duplicated &lt;code&gt;profiles&lt;/code&gt; block in the empty C# AppHost template.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🐛 Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⏱️ &lt;strong&gt;Explicit-start resources triggered lifecycle callbacks too early&lt;/strong&gt; — Session-scoped resources marked with &lt;code&gt;WithExplicitStart()&lt;/code&gt; were having their execution configuration callbacks (environment variables, arguments, certificates) evaluated at AppHost startup instead of at manual start. This meant user-interaction callbacks such as &lt;code&gt;WithEnvironment(ctx =&amp;gt; PromptForValueAsync(...))&lt;/code&gt; were called before the user triggered the resource. DCP registration is now deferred until the user manually starts the resource; persistent explicit-start resources still register immediately but patch the existing DCP record to &lt;code&gt;Start = true&lt;/code&gt; rather than deleting and recreating it. Fixes &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4567027026" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17813" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/issues/17813/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17813"&gt;#17813&lt;/a&gt;. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4568448365" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17825" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17825/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17825"&gt;#17825&lt;/a&gt;, backported via &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4568648993" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17826" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17826/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17826"&gt;#17826&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;code&gt;@danegsta&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔴 &lt;strong&gt;Redis with &lt;code&gt;WithLifetime(ContainerLifetime.Persistent)&lt;/code&gt; could deadlock on startup&lt;/strong&gt; — Redis TLS startup arguments used the public/allocated host ports instead of the internal target ports. When the public port differed from the target port (or was not yet allocated) the container would listen on an unexpected port and become unreachable. The TLS and non-TLS startup arguments now bind to target ports, matching what Redis expects internally. Fixes &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4568356018" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17822" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/issues/17822/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17822"&gt;#17822&lt;/a&gt;. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4568793536" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17827" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17827/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17827"&gt;#17827&lt;/a&gt;, backported via &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4574814008" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17850" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17850/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17850"&gt;#17850&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;code&gt;@danegsta&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔌 &lt;strong&gt;Proxyless container endpoint could hang when resolved before container creation&lt;/strong&gt; — Referencing a proxyless container endpoint in an environment variable callback (before the container port spec was finalized) could deadlock. An on-demand allocation path now commits the target port as the fallback host port in that case; once &lt;code&gt;BuildContainerPorts&lt;/code&gt; runs, normal DCP dynamic port assignment takes over for any later resolution. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4574829095" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17851" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17851/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17851"&gt;#17851&lt;/a&gt;, backported via &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4575705257" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17859" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17859/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17859"&gt;#17859&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;code&gt;@danegsta&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📄 &lt;strong&gt;Empty C# AppHost template emitted duplicate &lt;code&gt;profiles&lt;/code&gt; block&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;code&gt;aspire new aspire-empty&lt;/code&gt; on 13.4 produced an &lt;code&gt;aspire.config.json&lt;/code&gt; with a &lt;code&gt;profiles&lt;/code&gt; block that duplicated the content already present in &lt;code&gt;apphost.run.json&lt;/code&gt;, causing redundant launch configuration. The embedded template now contains only the required &lt;code&gt;appHost.path&lt;/code&gt; binding; profile configuration lives exclusively in &lt;code&gt;apphost.run.json&lt;/code&gt;. Fixes &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4547881005" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17660" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/issues/17660/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17660"&gt;#17660&lt;/a&gt;. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4560595960" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17781" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17781/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17781"&gt;#17781&lt;/a&gt;, backported via &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4568280053" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17820" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17820/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17820"&gt;#17820&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;code&gt;@mitchdenny&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🏷️ Housekeeping&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 Added Aspire CLI npm package to the release pipeline so the npm distribution is published as part of stable releases. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4482927132" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17297" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17297/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17297"&gt;#17297&lt;/a&gt;, backported via &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4559047720" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17766" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17766/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17766"&gt;#17766&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;code&gt;@adamint&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Bumped branding to 13.4.1 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4568251497" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17819" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17819/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17819"&gt;#17819&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full Changelog: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/compare/v13.4.0...v13.4.1"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v13.4.0...v13.4.1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full commit: &lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/commit/cf985fa817dd5863e7f62eb74fa1725ab5069ed2"&gt;cf985fa817dd5863e7f62eb74fa1725ab5069ed2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
